/Title (Total revenue of over 13,300 billion VND, up 29% over the same period. Non-interest income reached more than VND 2,400 billion, contributing 17% to total operating income. Operating expenses were well controlled, about VND 4,600 billion, with an increase of 12%, much lower than the increase in revenue. Cost/revenue ratio \(CIR\) dropped to 35%, cost effective at the top of the industry. Provision expense is estimated at more than 900 billion VND. Pre-tax profit in the third quarter reached VND 2,780 billion. By the end of the first 9 months of the year, VIB's pre-tax profit reached VND 7,800 billion, up 46% compared to the same period last year, the return on equity \(ROE\) reached 30%, among the top in the market.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2407 0 R
